Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:47:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(kanban): hub CPU/cap gate across named boards, profiles,
 primary/local boards and legacy/host-bound/policy cards; a never-created
 default board no longer blinds the host cap [daveey]

---
 hermes_cli/machine_metrics.py                 |  12 +-
 .../test_kanban_hub_admission_scopes.py       | 243 ++++++++++++++++++
 tests/hermes_cli/test_machine_metrics.py      |  21 ++
 3 files changed, 274 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_hub_admission_scopes.py

diff --git a/hermes_cli/machine_metrics.py b/hermes_cli/machine_metrics.py
